# Renesas Electronics Corporation

> Renesas (TYO: 6723) is a global semiconductor manufacturer producing
> microcontrollers, microprocessors, analog, power, sensor, and connectivity
> products for automotive, industrial, infrastructure, and consumer electronics
> applications. This file is a purpose-built index of Renesas product,
> application, and design-support content for AI crawlers and answer engines.

The Renesas website is published across three languages on multiple domains.
The content indexed below is the English version on www.renesas.com; some
support resources live on dedicated subdomains, and Simplified Chinese is
published on a separate domain entirely.

## Available Languages on Website

- [English (en)](https://www.renesas.com/en): Primary site, indexed in the sections below.
- [Japanese (ja)](https://www.renesas.com/ja): Full localization on the same domain.
- [Simplified Chinese (zh-cn)](https://www.renesas.cn/zh): Full localization on a separate domain (renesas.cn, not renesas.com).

## Products

Renesas product portfolio by category. Each is a hub for product families,
datasheets, parametric search, and selection tools.

- [Microcontrollers & Microprocessors](https://www.renesas.com/en/products/microcontrollers-microprocessors): MCUs and MPUs across the RA, RX, RL78, RH850, RZ, and Synergy families.
- [Amplifiers](https://www.renesas.com/en/products/amplifiers): Op amps, instrumentation amps, comparators, and specialty amplifiers.
- [ASIC & IP](https://www.renesas.com/en/products/asic-ip): Custom ASIC services and licensable IP cores.
- [Audio, Video & Display](https://www.renesas.com/en/products/audio-video-display): Display drivers, video processors, and audio ICs.
- [Automotive Products](https://www.renesas.com/en/products/automotive-products): Automotive-qualified MCUs, SoCs, power, and analog devices.
- [Clocks & Timing](https://www.renesas.com/en/products/clocks-timing): Oscillators, clock generators, jitter attenuators, and timing solutions.
- [Data Converters](https://www.renesas.com/en/products/data-converters): ADCs, DACs, and mixed-signal front ends.
- [Interface](https://www.renesas.com/en/products/interface): USB, PCIe, MIPI, level translators, and bus protocol devices.
- [Memory & Logic](https://www.renesas.com/en/products/memory-logic): SRAM, EEPROM, and standard logic devices.
- [Power Discretes](https://www.renesas.com/en/products/power-discretes): Discrete power transistors including silicon and GaN devices.
- [Power Management](https://www.renesas.com/en/products/power-management): PMICs, regulators, battery management, and power conversion ICs.
- [Programmable Logic](https://www.renesas.com/en/products/programmable-logic): GreenPAK and other programmable mixed-signal ICs.
- [Sensor Products](https://www.renesas.com/en/products/sensor-products): Optical, environmental, motion, and flow sensors.
- [Space & Harsh Environment](https://www.renesas.com/en/products/space-harsh-environment): Radiation-hardened and rad-tolerant devices for aerospace and defense.
- [Switches & Multiplexers](https://www.renesas.com/en/products/switches-multiplexers): Analog switches, multiplexers, and signal routing.
- [Wireless Connectivity](https://www.renesas.com/en/products/wireless-connectivity): Bluetooth, Wi-Fi, sub-GHz, and cellular IoT solutions.

## Applications

Application areas and key technologies served by Renesas products — reference
designs, app notes, and recommended product portfolios per area.

- [Automotive](https://www.renesas.com/en/applications/automotive): ADAS, E-Mobility, electric and hybrid vehicles, infotainment, vehicle control.
- [Consumer Electronics](https://www.renesas.com/en/applications/consumer-electronics): Cameras, computing, connected home and entertainment, power adapters and chargers, wearables.
- [Communications Infrastructure](https://www.renesas.com/en/applications/communications-infrastructure): Cloud and enterprise, networking and fixed access, wireless infrastructure.
- [Industrial](https://www.renesas.com/en/applications/industrial): Appliances, building and industrial automation, medical and healthcare, metering, motor drives, renewable energy and grid, retail/automation/payment, robotics.
- [Key Technologies](https://www.renesas.com/en/key-technologies): AI, Functional Safety, GaN power, HMI, motor control, security, tracking and locationing, USB.

## Design Resources

Tools and content for engineers designing with Renesas parts.

- [Boards & Kits](https://www.renesas.com/en/design-resources/boards-kits): Evaluation boards, development kits, and reference platforms (reference designs available as a filter view).
- [Development Tools](https://www.renesas.com/en/design-resources/development-tools): IDEs (e²studio), compilers, debuggers, and configuration tools (Smart Configurator).
- [Software & Drivers](https://www.renesas.com/en/design-resources/software-drivers): Firmware libraries, drivers, and middleware.
- [Documents & Downloads](https://www.renesas.com/en/support/document-search?page=0): Datasheets, application notes, user manuals, white papers.
- [Cross-Reference Search](https://www.renesas.com/en/support/cross-reference): Find Renesas equivalents for competitor part numbers.

## Support

Technical support, knowledge base, and product lifecycle information. Some
resources live on dedicated subdomains.

- [Knowledge Base](https://en-support.renesas.com/knowledgeBase): Searchable technical articles, FAQs, troubleshooting guides (en-support.renesas.com subdomain).
- [Support Communities](https://community.renesas.com/g): Forums covering Analog, Microcontrollers, Microprocessors, Power Management, Wireless Connectivity (community.renesas.com subdomain).
- [Supply Policy & Product Lifecycle](https://www.renesas.com/en/support/supply-policy-product-lifecycle): Lifecycle status, end-of-life policy, last-time-buy.
- [Product Longevity Program (PLP)](https://www.renesas.com/en/support/product-longevity-program-plp): Long-term availability commitments for industrial and automotive customers.
- [PSIRT](https://www.renesas.com/en/support/renesas-psirt): Product Security Incident Response Team — security disclosures and CVE coordination.
- [Quality & Reliability](https://www.renesas.com/en/support/quality-reliability): Quality and reliability reporting and standards.

